/* 0.9.5 — mail, gate, credits */
"Mizar Paid exists to provide what a high-bandwidth server can do: carrying a session's execution as it happens, attachments, and so on. Payment only shares the server cost and can barely be profitable. Free users can still use most features and the free server. Thank you for using it." = "Mizar付费版旨在为使用者提供高带宽服务器能做到的功能，包括会话执行过程传输、附件传输等。付费仅用于分摊服务器成本，基本无法盈利，同时免费用户依旧可以使用绝大部分功能与调用免费版服务器。感谢你的使用。";
"A Mizar account is required to use the app." = "使用 DSH-Mizar 需要先登录或注册。";
"A Mizar account is required to use the app. It keeps every relay session attributable to one person." = "使用 DSH-Mizar 需要一个 Mizar 账户：这样每一份中继流量都能对应到一个人。";
"A high-bandwidth relay, paid for by the people who need it. The free server stays free." = "高带宽中继由需要它的人分摊成本；免费服务器继续免费。";
"Collected from the four GitHub repositories and refreshed every 24 hours. Tap a name to open their GitHub profile." = "名单来自四个 GitHub 仓库，每 24 小时自动更新。点击一位开发者可打开其 GitHub 主页。";
