"Sign in to get started" = "登录后开始使用";
"DSH-Mizar's conversations travel through a relay. Once you sign in, every byte belongs to an account, so abnormal traffic can be recognised and stopped — that is what keeps the free server running." = "DSH-Mizar 的对话要经过中继服务器。登录后，每一份流量都能对应到一个账户，异常流量才能被识别和拦截——这是免费服务器能长期开下去的前提。";
"Signing in is only for the account and traffic safety; conversations never pass through the account server." = "登录只用于账户与流量安全，对话内容不经过账户服务器。";
